window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Being accused of treason against the paranormal community on Earth and getting dragged out of my apartment by ECU soldiers was nothing short of what I deserved. It's why I let them have their way with me, until five masked witches manage to kidnap me right in front of the soldiers.</p> <p>They claim I stole a dragon weapon from them together with Jane Dunham, and now they want me to find it. In return, they'll offer me a trial with the ECU, a chance to clear my name and get rid of the death sentence looming over me like an angry cloud. It was all I could have asked for, and I was mere hours from getting my freedom back, when the commander of the Unseelie army comes to find me with some very bad news.</p> <p>Now, I have a choice to make: save myself or try to stop my father from killing half the Court and ruining the peace treaty with Earth.</p> <p>There's a reason why I decided to start working on my own when Finn fired me from his agency. Somehow, along the way, I forgot all about it, but the time has come to remember who I want to spend the rest of my life fighting for.</p> <p>Contains mature themes.</p>"; 
